#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/index.rst:2
msgid "RELIC Workflows"
msgstr "RELIC 工作流"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/index.rst:4
msgid "Recomposable Ecosystem Library for Integrated Coupling (RELIC) organizes its runtime workflows around explicit state-space evolution, typed process composition, and parameter-governed calibration. Following standard dynamical systems and ecological modeling practice (state-variable formulation and mass-balance step operators, coupled multi-compartment and cross-scale graphs, and parameter estimation, sensitivity analysis, uncertainty propagation, and stochastic forcing), read these pages in sequence for a first simulation or enter at the track matching your task."
msgstr "可重组集成耦合生态系统库（Recomposable Ecosystem Library for Integrated Coupling, RELIC）围绕显式状态空间演化、类型化过程组合与参数受控校准组织运行时工作流。遵循动力系统与生态学建模通行规范（状态变量表达与质量平衡步进算子、多库室与跨尺度耦合图，以及参数估计、灵敏度分析、不确定性传播与随机强迫），首次运行模拟可按顺序阅读各页，也可直接切入对应任务路线。"

