#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/index.rst:42
msgid "For each task, follow this order:"
msgstr "每项任务按以下顺序执行："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/index.rst:44
msgid "Read the prerequisites and canonical-owner table before copying code."
msgstr "复制代码前，先阅读先决条件和 canonical-owner 表。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/index.rst:45
msgid "Run the smallest example and compare its output with the documented value."
msgstr "运行最小示例，并将输出与文档值比较。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/index.rst:46
msgid "Inspect state, units, diagnostics, provenance, and any generated files; do not use process exit alone as the acceptance criterion."
msgstr "检查状态、单位、diagnostic、provenance 和所有生成文件；不得仅以进程退出作为验收标准。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/index.rst:48
msgid "Exercise the relevant negative condition so that a missing input, invalid unit, conflicting writer, or failed assertion is known to stop correctly."
msgstr "执行相关负例，确认缺失输入、非法单位、writer 冲突或 assertion 失败时能够正确停止。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/index.rst:50
msgid "Move to the next page only after the current example and its checks pass."
msgstr "当前示例及其检查通过后，才进入下一页。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/index.rst:52
msgid "Notebook execution is intentionally separate from the public-site build. The batch runner below clears and rewrites output cells in the selected notebooks, so inspect the worktree first and use it only on notebooks you intend to refresh:"
msgstr "Notebook 执行与公开站构建有意分离。下方 batch runner 会清空并重写所选 notebook 的输出 cell，因此应先检查 worktree，并且只对确实要刷新的 notebook 使用："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/index.rst:64
msgid "After the selected notebook is green, run the distribution suite from the same unchanged source tree:"
msgstr "选定的 notebook 全绿后，在同一份未再改动的源码树上运行完整分发套件："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/index.rst:71
msgid "An executed notebook is acceptable when its summary status is ``ok``, it has no error outputs, no unexplained empty code outputs, its documented numerical checks pass, and the resulting diff contains only the intended notebook output refresh. Confirm that the report count equals 30 before distributing the suite. Use ``tutorial\\primary\\README.md`` for the full 30-notebook order."
msgstr "当执行摘要状态为 ``ok``、没有 error output、没有无法解释的空代码单元输出、文档规定的数值检查通过，且 diff 仅包含预期的 notebook 输出刷新时，该 notebook 才可验收。分发套件前，还必须确认报告中的 notebook 数量等于 30。30 个 notebook 的完整顺序见 ``tutorial\\primary\\README.md``。"

